    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Fragmented data stores</span><span class="badge st st-existing">Existing</span></div>
    <div class="note">Partial lakehouse; core data still on mainframe.</div>
  </div></div>
  </div><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Core Systems of Record</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-system">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Trade Finance system</span><span class="badge st st-existing">Existing</span></div>
    
  </div><div class="node k-system">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">FIS IST/Profile core</span><span class="badge st st-existing">Existing</span></div>
    <div class="svc">FIS IST/Profile (mainframe)</div>
  </div><div class="node k-control">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">NICE Actimize</span><span class="badge st st-existing">Existing</span></div>
    <div class="svc">Actimize + Feedzai</div><div class="note">AML / fraud screening.</div>
  </div></div>
  </div></div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Email / courier intake</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">Manual document review</span><span class="flbl">documents</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Manual document review</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">Trade Finance system</span><span class="flbl">keyed data</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Manual document review</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">Manual exception tracking</span><span class="flbl">exceptions</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Trade Finance system</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">FIS IST/Profile core</span><span class="flbl">postings</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-event">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Trade Finance system</span><span class="arrow" data-k="event">→</span><span class="tile">NICE Actimize</span><span class="flbl">screening</span><span class="badge fk fk-event">Event</span></div>
        
      </div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> Data moves through manual handoffs before it becomes a controlled system record.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Target architecture must add structured intake and evidence lineage before AI recommendations.</p>
  </section>
    <section class="exhibit" id="current_state_gaps_map" data-exhibit="current_state_gaps_map">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">5</span><h2>Current-state gaps map</h2></div>
    <div class="visual-body"><svg class="diagram timeline" viewBox="0 0 760 214" role="img" aria-label="Architecture flow diagram">
    <defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--changed)"/></marker></defs>
    <path d="M180 92 L304 92" stroke="var(--changed)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="132" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--changed)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="132" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">1</text>
        <text x="132" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="132" dy="0">Event-driven document</tspan><tspan x="132" dy="14">intake...</tspan></text>
        <text x="132" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="132" dy="0">The process lacks a governed</tspan><tspan x="132" dy="12">intake...</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M400 92 L524 92" stroke="var(--changed)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="352" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--changed)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="352" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">2</text>
        <text x="352" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="352" dy="0">Grounded AI-assisted</tspan><tspan x="352" dy="14">clause...</tspan></text>
        <text x="352" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="352" dy="0">There is no governed retrieval</tspan><tspan x="352" dy="12">layer...</tspan></text>
      </g><g>
        <circle cx="572" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--changed)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="572" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">3</text>
        <text x="572" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="572" dy="0">Controlled exception</tspan><tspan x="572" dy="14">decision...</tspan></text>
        <text x="572" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="572" dy="0">Human approval exists, but the</tspan><tspan x="572" dy="12">approval...</tspan></text>
      </g>
  </svg><div class="grid2"><div class="card"><div class="card-h">The process lacks a governed intake layer and reliable queue telemetry.</div><div class="note">Documents arrive through email/courier and are triaged manually.</div><div class="outcome">Introduce structured intake, extraction, and event telemetry before any AI recommendation is trusted.</div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-h">There is no governed retrieval layer for L/C terms, UCP rules, and decision evidence.</div><div class="note">Clause comparison depends on officer memory and fragmented references.</div><div class="outcome">Ground clause comparison in a governed corpus with traceable retrieval and citations.</div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-h">Human approval exists, but the approval trail is not captured as a controlled decision system.</div><div class="note">Exceptions are assembled in spreadsheets and email threads.</div><div class="outcome">Put officer approval, model-risk validation, AML screening, and audit telemetry into the target flow.</div></div></div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> Each observed gap translates into a specific target capability.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Use the gaps as build acceptance criteria.</p>
  </section>
    <section class="exhibit" id="target_conceptual_architecture" data-exhibit="target_conceptual_architecture">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">6</span><h2>Target conceptual architecture</h2></div>
    <div class="visual-body"><svg class="diagram timeline" viewBox="0 0 1364 214" role="img" aria-label="Architecture flow diagram">
    <defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--data)"/></marker></defs>
    <path d="M180 92 L304 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="132" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="132" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">1</text>
        <text x="132" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="132" dy="0">Sense: document intake</tspan></text>
        <text x="132" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="132" dy="0">Experience &amp; Channels</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M400 92 L524 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="352" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="352" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">2</text>
        <text x="352" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="352" dy="0">Context: terms + UCP</tspan><tspan x="352" dy="14">rules</tspan></text>
        <text x="352" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="352" dy="0">Data &amp; ML Platform</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M620 92 L744 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="572" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="572" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">3</text>
        <text x="572" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="572" dy="0">Recommend: AI</tspan><tspan x="572" dy="14">discrepancy...</tspan></text>
        <text x="572" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="572" dy="0">Agentic Orchestration</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M840 92 L964 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="792" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="792" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">4</text>
        <text x="792" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="792" dy="0">Approve: officer</tspan><tspan x="792" dy="14">judgment</tspan></text>
        <text x="792" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="792" dy="0">Core Systems of Record</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M1060 92 L1184 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="1012" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="1012" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">5</text>
        <text x="1012" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="1012" dy="0">Act: core posting</tspan></text>
        <text x="1012" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="1012" dy="0">Core Systems of Record</tspan></text>
      </g><g>
        <circle cx="1232" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="1232" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">6</text>
        <text x="1232" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="1232" dy="0">Measure: lineage + value</tspan></text>
        <text x="1232" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="1232" dy="0">Cloud &amp; Platform</tspan></text>
      </g>
  </svg><p class="caption">The business design is a governed decision system: intake, context enrichment, AI recommendation, officer approval, system action, and value telemetry.</p><div class="statemap"><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Experience &amp; Channels</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-channel">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Sense: document intake</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div></div>
  </div><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Agentic Orchestration</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-agent">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Recommend: AI discrepancy finding</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div></div>
  </div><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Data &amp; ML Platform</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-data_store">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Context: terms + UCP rules</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div></div>
  </div><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Core Systems of Record</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-control">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Approve: officer judgment</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div><div class="node k-system">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Act: core posting</span><span class="badge st st-changed">Changed</span></div>
    
  </div></div>
  </div><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Cloud &amp; Platform</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-control">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Measure: lineage + value</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div></div>
  </div></div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Sense: document intake</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">Context: terms + UCP rules</span><span class="flbl">documents + terms</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Context: terms + UCP rules</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Recommend: AI discrepancy finding</span><span class="flbl">grounded recommendation</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-human_approval">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Recommend: AI discrepancy finding</span><span class="arrow" data-k="human_approval">→</span><span class="tile">Approve: officer judgment</span><span class="flbl">exception approval</span><span class="badge fk fk-human_approval">Human approval</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Approve: officer judgment</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">Act: core posting</span><span class="flbl">approved action</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-event">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Act: core posting</span><span class="arrow" data-k="event">→</span><span class="tile">Measure: lineage + value</span><span class="flbl">audit + value telemetry</span><span class="badge fk fk-event">Event</span></div>
        
      </div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> The solution is a governed decision loop, not an isolated model.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Align first on capabilities and control points.</p>
  </section>
    <section class="exhibit" id="target_logical_architecture" data-exhibit="target_logical_architecture">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">7</span><h2>Target logical architecture</h2></div>
    <div class="visual-body"><svg class="diagram timeline" viewBox="0 0 1584 214" role="img" aria-label="Architecture flow diagram">
    <defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--data)"/></marker></defs>
    <path d="M180 92 L304 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="132" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="132" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">1</text>
        <text x="132" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="132" dy="0">Officer workbench</tspan></text>
        <text x="132" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="132" dy="0">Experience &amp; Channels</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M400 92 L524 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="352" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="352" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">2</text>
        <text x="352" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="352" dy="0">API facade</tspan></text>
        <text x="352" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="352" dy="0">Integration &amp; Rails</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M620 92 L744 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
