      </g>
  </svg><p class="caption">Logical components separate intake, orchestration, retrieval, model serving, exception assembly, approval, and system integration.</p><div class="statemap"><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Experience &amp; Channels</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-channel">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Officer workbench</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div></div>
  </div><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Agentic Orchestration</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-agent">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Agent orchestrator</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div></div>
  </div><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Applications &amp; Services</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-service">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Extraction service</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div><div class="node k-model">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Model serving</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div></div>
  </div><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Data &amp; ML Platform</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-data_store">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Retrieval service</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div></div>
  </div><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Integration &amp; Rails</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-integration">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">API facade</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div></div>
  </div><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Core Systems of Record</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-control">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Risk / AML controls</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    
  </div><div class="node k-system">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Trade Finance core</span><span class="badge st st-changed">Changed</span></div>
    
  </div></div>
  </div></div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Officer workbench</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">API facade</span><span class="flbl">document package</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-event">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">API facade</span><span class="arrow" data-k="event">→</span><span class="tile">Agent orchestrator</span><span class="flbl">case event</span><span class="badge fk fk-event">Event</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Agent orchestrator</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Extraction service</span><span class="flbl">extract</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Agent orchestrator</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">Retrieval service</span><span class="flbl">retrieve evidence</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Agent orchestrator</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Model serving</span><span class="flbl">reason over clauses</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Model serving</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Risk / AML controls</span><span class="flbl">validate / screen</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-human_approval">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Officer workbench</span><span class="arrow" data-k="human_approval">→</span><span class="tile">Trade Finance core</span><span class="flbl">approved posting</span><span class="badge fk fk-human_approval">Human approval</span></div>
        
      </div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> The component model separates data movement from AI control flow.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Approve component ownership and integration contracts.</p>
  </section>
    <section class="exhibit" id="target_physical_deployment" data-exhibit="target_physical_deployment">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">8</span><h2>Target physical / deployment architecture</h2></div>
    <div class="visual-body"><svg class="diagram timeline" viewBox="0 0 1584 214" role="img" aria-label="Architecture flow diagram">
    <defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--data)"/></marker></defs>
