      </div><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Amazon EventBridge</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Textract + Bedrock</span><span class="flbl">parse / reason</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Textract + Bedrock</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">Databricks on AWS</span><span class="flbl">evidence + embeddings</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Textract + Bedrock</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Actimize / Feedzai / MRM</span><span class="flbl">risk checks</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Amazon API Gateway</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">FIS IST/Profile</span><span class="flbl">approved posting</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Databricks on AWS</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">Snowflake finance mart</span><span class="flbl">value telemetry</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">AWS landing zone</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Amazon API Gateway</span><span class="flbl">identity / encryption / audit</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> The physical design stays inside the bank's AWS/Databricks target estate while integrating the FIS core.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Approve the deployment boundary, identity model, and mainframe integration path.</p>
