        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Event bus</span><span class="arrow" data-k="event">→</span><span class="tile">L/C orchestrator agent</span><span class="flbl">document arrived</span><span class="badge fk fk-event">Event</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Clause-comparison agent</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">Retrieval / vector index</span><span class="flbl">retrieve terms + UCP rules</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Trade Finance workbench</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">Trade Finance system</span><span class="flbl">approved posting</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Trade Finance system</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">FIS IST/Profile core</span><span class="flbl">core update</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-event">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Discrepancy / exception agent</span><span class="arrow" data-k="event">→</span><span class="tile">AML / fraud control</span><span class="flbl">AML screening</span><span class="badge fk fk-event">Event</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-data">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Lakehouse</span><span class="arrow" data-k="data">→</span><span class="tile">Retrieval / vector index</span><span class="flbl">governed corpus</span><span class="badge fk fk-data">Data</span></div>
        
      </div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> Document, term, retrieval, approval, and posting data flows are visible end to end.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Validate where lineage must be captured for audit and value measurement.</p>
  </section>
    <section class="exhibit" id="ai_recommendation_control_flow" data-exhibit="ai_recommendation_control_flow">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">10</span><h2>AI recommendation &amp; decision-control flow</h2></div>
    <div class="visual-body"><div class="legend"><span class="l-control">AI control / decision flow</span></div><h3 style="font-size:15px;margin:0 0 10px">AI decision &amp; control flow</h3><svg class="diagram timeline" viewBox="0 0 1364 214" role="img" aria-label="Architecture flow diagram">
    <defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--control)"/></marker></defs>
    <path d="M180 92 L304 92" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="132" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="132" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">1</text>
        <text x="132" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="132" dy="0">L/C orchestrator agent →</tspan><tspan x="132" dy="14">Intake...</tspan></text>
        <text x="132" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="132" dy="0">extract</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M400 92 L524 92" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="352" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="352" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">2</text>
        <text x="352" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="352" dy="0">Intake &amp; extraction</tspan><tspan x="352" dy="14">agent...</tspan></text>
        <text x="352" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="352" dy="0">OCR + parse</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M620 92 L744 92" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="572" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="572" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">3</text>
        <text x="572" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="572" dy="0">L/C orchestrator agent →</tspan><tspan x="572" dy="14">Clause-comparison...</tspan></text>
        <text x="572" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="572" dy="0">compare clauses</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M840 92 L964 92" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="792" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="792" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">4</text>
        <text x="792" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="792" dy="0">L/C orchestrator agent →</tspan><tspan x="792" dy="14">Discrepancy...</tspan></text>
        <text x="792" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="792" dy="0">flag discrepancies</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M1060 92 L1184 92" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="1012" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="1012" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">5</text>
        <text x="1012" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="1012" dy="0">Discrepancy / exception</tspan><tspan x="1012" dy="14">agent...</tspan></text>
        <text x="1012" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="1012" dy="0">officer reviews exception</tspan></text>
      </g><g>
        <circle cx="1232" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="1232" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">6</text>
        <text x="1232" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="1232" dy="0">Clause-comparison agent</tspan><tspan x="1232" dy="14">→...</tspan></text>
        <text x="1232" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="1232" dy="0">model-risk check</tspan></text>
      </g>
  </svg><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">L/C orchestrator agent</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Intake &amp; extraction agent</span><span class="flbl">extract</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Intake &amp; extraction agent</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Document AI service</span><span class="flbl">OCR + parse</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">L/C orchestrator agent</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Clause-comparison agent</span><span class="flbl">compare clauses</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">L/C orchestrator agent</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Discrepancy / exception agent</span><span class="flbl">flag discrepancies</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-human_approval">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Discrepancy / exception agent</span><span class="arrow" data-k="human_approval">→</span><span class="tile">Trade Finance workbench</span><span class="flbl">officer reviews exception</span><span class="badge fk fk-human_approval">Human approval</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="flow k-control">
        <div class="flow-line"><span class="tile">Clause-comparison agent</span><span class="arrow" data-k="control">→</span><span class="tile">Model-risk control</span><span class="flbl">model-risk check</span><span class="badge fk fk-control">AI control</span></div>
        
      </div><h3 style="font-size:15px;margin:22px 0 10px">Agentic overlay — how the services come alive</h3><div class="agents"><div class="agent">
        <div class="agent-h"><span class="dot"></span><strong>Intake &amp; extraction agent</strong><span class="role">Extracts structured fields from unstructured L/C documents</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Calls</span><span class="chip">Document AI service</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Grounds on</span><span class="chip ground">Lakehouse</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Guarded by</span><span class="chip guard">Model-risk control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="agent">
        <div class="agent-h"><span class="dot"></span><strong>Clause-comparison agent</strong><span class="role">Compares presented documents against L/C terms and UCP 600 rules</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Calls</span><span class="chip">Foundation model serving</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Grounds on</span><span class="chip ground">Retrieval / vector index</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Guarded by</span><span class="chip guard">Model-risk control</span></div>
        <div class="hil">Human-in-the-loop: Officer confirms any low-confidence clause match</div>
      </div><div class="agent">
        <div class="agent-h"><span class="dot"></span><strong>Discrepancy / exception agent</strong><span class="role">Identifies discrepancies and assembles the exception for review</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Calls</span><span class="chip">Foundation model serving</span><span class="chip">Trade Finance system</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Grounds on</span><span class="chip ground">Retrieval / vector index</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Guarded by</span><span class="chip guard">AML / fraud control</span><span class="chip guard">Model-risk control</span></div>
        <div class="hil">Human-in-the-loop: Trade-finance officer approves, overrides, or rejects every exception</div>
      </div></div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> AI recommends and assembles exceptions; officers approve the controlled decision.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Decide which exceptions can be AI-recommended in the pilot.</p>
  </section>
    <section class="exhibit" id="human_approval_override_model" data-exhibit="human_approval_override_model">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">11</span><h2>Human approval / override model</h2></div>
    <div class="visual-body"><svg class="diagram timeline" viewBox="0 0 760 214" role="img" aria-label="Architecture flow diagram">
    <defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--control)"/></marker></defs>
    <path d="M180 92 L304 92" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="132" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="132" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">1</text>
        <text x="132" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="132" dy="0">Clause-comparison agent</tspan></text>
        <text x="132" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="132" dy="0">Officer confirms any</tspan><tspan x="132" dy="12">low-confidence...</tspan></text>
      </g><g>
        <circle cx="352" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="352" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">2</text>
        <text x="352" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="352" dy="0">Discrepancy / exception</tspan><tspan x="352" dy="14">agent</tspan></text>
        <text x="352" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="352" dy="0">Trade-finance officer approves,</tspan><tspan x="352" dy="12">overrides,...</tspan></text>
      </g>
  </svg><div class="agents"><div class="agent">
        <div class="agent-h"><span class="dot"></span><strong>Intake &amp; extraction agent</strong><span class="role">Extracts structured fields from unstructured L/C documents</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Calls</span><span class="chip">Document AI service</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Grounds on</span><span class="chip ground">Lakehouse</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Guarded by</span><span class="chip guard">Model-risk control</span></div>
        
      </div><div class="agent">
        <div class="agent-h"><span class="dot"></span><strong>Clause-comparison agent</strong><span class="role">Compares presented documents against L/C terms and UCP 600 rules</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Calls</span><span class="chip">Foundation model serving</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Grounds on</span><span class="chip ground">Retrieval / vector index</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Guarded by</span><span class="chip guard">Model-risk control</span></div>
        <div class="hil">Human-in-the-loop: Officer confirms any low-confidence clause match</div>
      </div><div class="agent">
        <div class="agent-h"><span class="dot"></span><strong>Discrepancy / exception agent</strong><span class="role">Identifies discrepancies and assembles the exception for review</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Calls</span><span class="chip">Foundation model serving</span><span class="chip">Trade Finance system</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Grounds on</span><span class="chip ground">Retrieval / vector index</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span class="lk">Guarded by</span><span class="chip guard">AML / fraud control</span><span class="chip guard">Model-risk control</span></div>
        <div class="hil">Human-in-the-loop: Trade-finance officer approves, overrides, or rejects every exception</div>
      </div></div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> The officer remains accountable for low-confidence and exception decisions.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Approve the human-in-the-loop threshold and override policy.</p>
  </section>
    <section class="exhibit" id="integration_map" data-exhibit="integration_map">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">12</span><h2>Integration map</h2></div>
    <div class="visual-body"><svg class="diagram timeline" viewBox="0 0 1364 214" role="img" aria-label="Architecture flow diagram">
    <defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--data)"/></marker></defs>
    <path d="M180 92 L304 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="132" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="132" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">1</text>
        <text x="132" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="132" dy="0">Event bus</tspan></text>
        <text x="132" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="132" dy="0">Amazon EventBridge</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M400 92 L524 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="352" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="352" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">2</text>
        <text x="352" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="352" dy="0">API gateway</tspan></text>
        <text x="352" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="352" dy="0">Amazon API Gateway</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M620 92 L744 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="572" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="572" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">3</text>
        <text x="572" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="572" dy="0">Trade Finance system</tspan></text>
        
      </g><path d="M840 92 L964 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="792" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="792" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">4</text>
        <text x="792" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="792" dy="0">FIS IST/Profile core</tspan></text>
        <text x="792" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="792" dy="0">FIS IST/Profile (mainframe)</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M1060 92 L1184 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="1012" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="1012" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">5</text>
        <text x="1012" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="1012" dy="0">Model-risk control</tspan></text>
        
      </g><g>
        <circle cx="1232" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="1232" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">6</text>
        <text x="1232" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="1232" dy="0">AML / fraud control</tspan></text>
        <text x="1232" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="1232" dy="0">Actimize + Feedzai</tspan></text>
      </g>
  </svg><div class="statemap"><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Integration &amp; Rails</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-integration">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Event bus</span><span class="badge prov prov-aws">AWS</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    <div class="svc">Amazon EventBridge</div><div class="note">Document-arrival events drive the pipeline.</div>
  </div><div class="node k-integration">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">API gateway</span><span class="badge prov prov-aws">AWS</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    <div class="svc">Amazon API Gateway</div>
  </div></div>
  </div><div class="band">
    <div class="band-label">Core Systems of Record</div>
    <div class="band-nodes"><div class="node k-system">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Trade Finance system</span><span class="badge st st-changed">Changed</span></div>
    <div class="note">Integrated via API — not replaced.</div>
  </div><div class="node k-system">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">FIS IST/Profile core</span><span class="badge st st-existing">Existing</span></div>
    <div class="svc">FIS IST/Profile (mainframe)</div>
  </div><div class="node k-control">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">Model-risk control</span><span class="badge st st-new">New</span></div>
    <div class="note">SR 11-7 validation + monitoring.</div>
  </div><div class="node k-control">
    <div class="node-h"><span class="node-label">AML / fraud control</span><span class="badge st st-existing">Existing</span></div>
    <div class="svc">Actimize + Feedzai</div>
  </div></div>
  </div></div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> The design adds integration rails around the core rather than replacing it.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Prioritize API and event contracts early.</p>
  </section>
    <section class="exhibit" id="governance_audit_telemetry_flow" data-exhibit="governance_audit_telemetry_flow">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">13</span><h2>Governance, audit, and telemetry flow</h2></div>
    <div class="visual-body"><svg class="diagram timeline" viewBox="0 0 924 214" role="img" aria-label="Architecture flow diagram">
    <defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--control)"/></marker></defs>
    <path d="M180 92 L304 92" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="132" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="132" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">1</text>
        <text x="132" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="132" dy="0">SR 11-7 model risk</tspan></text>
        <text x="132" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="132" dy="0">Model Risk Management</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M400 92 L524 92" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="352" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="352" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">2</text>
        <text x="352" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="352" dy="0">BSA/AML screening</tspan></text>
        <text x="352" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="352" dy="0">Financial Crime</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M620 92 L744 92" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="572" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="572" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">3</text>
        <text x="572" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="572" dy="0">Officer approval gate</tspan></text>
        <text x="572" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="572" dy="0">Trade Finance Ops</tspan></text>
      </g><g>
        <circle cx="792" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--control)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="792" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">4</text>
        <text x="792" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="792" dy="0">Lineage &amp; audit</tspan></text>
        <text x="792" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="792" dy="0">Architecture / Risk</tspan></text>
      </g>
  </svg><div class="grid2"><div class="card"><div class="card-h">SR 11-7 model risk</div><div class="note">Every model decision is validated, versioned, and monitored.</div><div class="owner">Model Risk Management</div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-h">BSA/AML screening</div><div class="note">Discrepancies route through Actimize/Feedzai before posting.</div><div class="owner">Financial Crime</div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-h">Officer approval gate</div><div class="note">Exceptions require human approval; AI never auto-clears a discrepancy.</div><div class="owner">Trade Finance Ops</div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-h">Lineage &amp; audit</div><div class="note">Every extraction, comparison, and decision is logged with its evidence.</div><div class="owner">Architecture / Risk</div></div></div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> Risk, AML, lineage, and value telemetry are part of the workflow.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Make telemetry and model-risk evidence non-negotiable build scope.</p>
  </section>
    <section class="exhibit" id="implementation_waves" data-exhibit="implementation_waves">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">14</span><h2>Implementation waves</h2></div>
    <div class="visual-body"><svg class="diagram timeline" viewBox="0 0 760 214" role="img" aria-label="Architecture flow diagram">
    <defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--data)"/></marker></defs>
    <path d="M180 92 L304 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="132" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="132" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">1</text>
        <text x="132" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="132" dy="0">Wave 1 — Foundation</tspan></text>
        <text x="132" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="132" dy="0">0–90 days</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M400 92 L524 92" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="352" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="352" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">2</text>
        <text x="352" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="352" dy="0">Wave 2 — Comparison &amp;</tspan><tspan x="352" dy="14">exceptions</tspan></text>
        <text x="352" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="352" dy="0">3–6 months</tspan></text>
      </g><g>
        <circle cx="572" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--data)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="572" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">3</text>
        <text x="572" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="572" dy="0">Wave 3 — Scale &amp;</tspan><tspan x="572" dy="14">straight-through</tspan></text>
        <text x="572" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="572" dy="0">6–12 months</tspan></text>
      </g>
  </svg><div class="waves"><div class="wave"><div class="wave-h"><strong>Wave 1 — Foundation</strong><span class="win">0–90 days</span></div><ul><li>Lakehouse</li><li>Retrieval / vector index</li><li>Intake &amp; extraction agent</li><li>Trade Finance workbench</li></ul><div class="outcome">Documents ingested and extracted; officer workbench live in shadow mode.</div></div><div class="wave"><div class="wave-h"><strong>Wave 2 — Comparison &amp; exceptions</strong><span class="win">3–6 months</span></div><ul><li>Clause-comparison agent</li><li>Discrepancy / exception agent</li><li>Model-risk control</li></ul><div class="outcome">AI-assisted clause comparison and exception assembly, officer-approved.</div></div><div class="wave"><div class="wave-h"><strong>Wave 3 — Scale &amp; straight-through</strong><span class="win">6–12 months</span></div><ul><li>L/C orchestrator agent</li><li>Event bus</li><li>AML / fraud control</li></ul><div class="outcome">Low-risk cases flow straight through with controls hardened; throughput scales.</div></div></div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> The waves de-risk by proving intake and evidence first, then comparison, then scale.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Fund Wave 1 as a controlled proof, not a full transformation bet.</p>
  </section>
    <section class="exhibit" id="architecture_decision_log" data-exhibit="architecture_decision_log">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">15</span><h2>Architecture decision log</h2></div>
    <div class="visual-body"><svg class="diagram timeline" viewBox="0 0 760 214" role="img" aria-label="Architecture flow diagram">
    <defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--accent)"/></marker></defs>
    <path d="M180 92 L304 92" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="132" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="132" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">1</text>
        <text x="132" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="132" dy="0">recommended</tspan></text>
        <text x="132" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="132" dy="0">No — AI may recommend and</tspan><tspan x="132" dy="12">assemble...</tspan></text>
      </g><path d="M400 92 L524 92" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><g>
        <circle cx="352" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="352" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">2</text>
        <text x="352" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="352" dy="0">recommended</tspan></text>
        <text x="352" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="352" dy="0">No — integrate via governed APIs</tspan><tspan x="352" dy="12">and...</tspan></text>
      </g><g>
        <circle cx="572" cy="92" r="28" fill="#fff" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <text x="572" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="700">3</text>
        <text x="572" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700"><tspan x="572" dy="0">open</tspan></text>
        <text x="572" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b66"><tspan x="572" dy="0">Capture intake timestamps,</tspan><tspan x="572" dy="12">retrieval...</tspan></text>
      </g>
  </svg><div class="grid2"><div class="card"><div class="card-h">Should AI be allowed to auto-clear L/C exceptions in the pilot?</div><div class="outcome">No — AI may recommend and assemble evidence, but officers approve every exception.</div><div class="note">The bank needs SR 11-7 evidence, AML alignment, and operational confidence before widening automation.</div><span class="badge">recommended</span></div><div class="card"><div class="card-h">Should the target replace the FIS core?</div><div class="outcome">No — integrate via governed APIs and postings.</div><div class="note">The value case is trapped in review and exception handling, not core replacement.</div><span class="badge">recommended</span></div><div class="card"><div class="card-h">Which telemetry is mandatory for build approval?</div><div class="outcome">Capture intake timestamps, retrieval evidence, model version, officer action, override reason, AML screening, and posting outcome.</div><div class="note">Without telemetry, the pilot cannot prove cycle-time, risk, or control value.</div><span class="badge">open</span></div></div></div>
    <p class="so-what"><strong>So what:</strong> The key decisions are explicit enough for an architecture review board.</p>
    <p class="decision-implication"><strong>Decision implication:</strong> Resolve deployment, approval, and integration decisions before build starts.</p>
  </section>
    <section id="patterns">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">16</span><h2>Architecture patterns</h2></div>
    <p class="caption">The patterns the design relies on, and why each matters.</p>
    <div class="grid2"><div class="card"><div class="card-h">RAG (grounded clause comparison)</div><div class="note">Comparisons cite the actual L/C terms and UCP rules — auditable, not a black box.</div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-h">Tool-use</div><div class="note">Agents call governed systems (document AI, trade-finance system) rather than hold private state.</div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-h">Multi-agent orchestration</div><div class="note">Each step is a bounded, testable agent — easier to validate for model risk.</div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-h">Event-driven</div><div class="note">Document arrival drives the pipeline; throughput scales without adding headcount.</div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-h">Human-in-the-loop</div><div class="note">No exception clears without an officer — control and accountability preserved.</div></div></div>
  </section>
    <section id="decisions">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="num">17</span><h2>Open inputs required</h2></div>
    <p class="caption">What the architecture leadership still needs to confirm.</p>
    <div class="open-inputs"><div class="card-h">Open Inputs Required</div><ul><li>Annual L/C volume</li><li>Manual touch time per L/C</li><li>Average cycle time (receipt to decision)</li><li>Discrepancy rate</li><li>Current fully-loaded unit cost per L/C</li></ul></div>
  </section>
  </div>
</body></html>"
`;
